</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>0 on success, or a positive error number on failure. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ulink url="https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/pthread_setname_np.html">https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/pthread_setname_np.html</ulink> </para>
